    "claims": [
      "Delivery worksheet shows item availability and whether orders can ship partially or in full",
      "Reserves stock automatically by delivery date, customer priority or order date",
      "One-click reservations with a priority rule that can differ per worksheet",
      "Creates warehouse documents directly from the delivery worksheet",
      "Runs a customer credit check before shipment and asks for authorisation",
      "Named users can approve shipments when credit limits are exceeded or payments overdue",
      "Unapproved shipments can be excluded from allocation",
      "Merges orders for the same delivery address into one warehouse document",
      "Adds order and customer source details to warehouse documents for 3PL providers",
      "Shows reservations against stock and against planned receipts separately",
      "Supports multiple locations with owned and outsourced warehouses",
      "Runs on Essentials and Premium editions",
      "Priced per production environment with unlimited sandboxes and users",
      "30-day free trial"
